rsion directly from where you saved the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Library in Steam. Right click on Yukina's Diary Demo. Go to Manage and select Browse Local Files. Go to the folder </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy the folder save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the full version of Yukinas Diary. Right click on manage local files. In the folder www you paste the copied folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also came up with something <strong>Special</strong> for the Early Access participants:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a Follower of my Twitch Channel you will receive giveaways that allow you to immortalize yourself in the Game during the Early Access phase. More info on my Twitch channel, which you can access directly from the game itself. This privilege will expire as soon as the Game is released as a full Version. Be a part of something big.</strong></p>","developers":["J_WGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005080/header.jpg?t=1773482779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1005080/270492/8bf1b77d7d47f453aaf727ebe3c0b9bcddf9c795/1751175149/dash_av1.mpd?t=1583701107","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1005080/270492/8bf1b77d7d47f453aaf727ebe3c0b9bcddf9c795/1751175149/dash_h264.mpd?t=1583701107","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1005080/270492/8bf1b77d7d47f453aaf727ebe3c0b9bcddf9c795/1751175149/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1583701107","id":256777112,"name":"Yukinas Diary Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as